# What NOT to include in the Elastic Beanstalk source bundle. EB builds the
# image from the Dockerfile, so dependencies and build outputs are recreated
# there and must not be uploaded. Source, package manifests, the lockfile,
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, the Dockerfile, and .platform/ ARE included.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vite/
coverage/
eval-results/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.git/
*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
docs/assignment.pdf
